---
description: Arcane guidance adapter for feature-family ports
globs: Modules/Arcane/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---
For a port, read the `porting`, `upstream-maintenance`, `module-architecture`, and `testing` skills plus `.agents/rules/third-party-materials.md` and `.agents/rules/port-destination.md`. Build a source PR family manifest and adapt integration edits to current Goob Reforged code.

Destination: port into `Modules/Arcane/**` or `Content.Arcane.*` per `.agents/rules/port-destination.md`. Prefer `Content.Trauma.*` when the feature should survive a sync. Source markers do not travel: the ported change is ours, so it carries Arcane markers. The only unavoidable exception is a base-type change, and that is wrapped in the smallest Arcane block.

Add `en-US` and `ru-RU` locale entries in matching positions, and carry asset licensing and attribution.
